      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.88 (up from ₹4.03 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹576.5m (up 123% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹4.43m (up ₹24.7m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.8% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 54% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 24% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
